              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kym Cox Surridge"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good—sweet, but not too sweet. I juiced the ginger with the carrots and apple. The texture is somewhat thick, like a runny milkshake. For me, it’s a bit rich for morning juice, so if I made it again, I’d add water from a young coconut to thin it out."
